     public_transcript -- prior public turns (empty at the opening).
     living_ids        -- optional tuple: living players minus this speaker, the only
                          valid accusation targets (guarded on a non-empty value, so
                          an ad-hoc render that omits it drops the block).
     dead_ids          -- optional tuple: dead / ejected players, the do-not-accuse
                          line under the living roster (guarded like living_ids).

